# The deepest nesting through the location tree: the contents of the
# office, item 1 there in its form, the location pick list over it and
# the help over that.  Each list on the way is paged to its end and back
# first (End, Home), so that it holds its ring of page cursors.
#@ DEEP
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L
T B
K END HOME ENTER END HOME ENTER CTRL-E TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
K F4 END HOME
S DEEPPICK
K F1
S DEEPPHLP
K ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
